{"3109460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sudden Soul", "steam_appid": 3109460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>No prophecies. No legends foretold. No destined hero.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/aa16d36d05c5891e693094fbd5c5cbce.gif?t=1783178219\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/aa16d36d05c5891e693094fbd5c5cbce.poster.avif?t=1783178219\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/d9c0b01cde3718c76a98294b00ce8849.avif?t=1783178219\" width=149 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blackout within the city of Oasys causes havoc as people and creatures wake up with new powers. Each party member controls an element which can combo off another. Light up an enemy who just got oil bombed, electrocute a ruffian after they got drenched in water - and many more possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/2189351e2e715e2269c3527add756dca.poster.avif?t=1783178219\" width=84 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/2189351e2e715e2269c3527add756dca.webm?t=1783178219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/2189351e2e715e2269c3527add756dca.mp4?t=1783178219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/0adada0a16a7b870eb76455fc91f95e6.avif?t=1783178219\" width=83 height=89 /></span>        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/5b3e32b7daa4109edbba98ad5840f978.webp?t=1783178219\" width=54 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG with CCG (Collectible Card Game) elements. Open booster packs, upgrade your existing cards and try various card modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member specializes in a different elemental power that can combo off another.  Experiment to see what fits your playstyle or adjust to a challenging encounter. Tangle up your enemies with some plants after exposing them to water and sunshine or torment your already burning enemies by fanning the flames and throwing oil - the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platforming overworld. Explore Oasys to find interesting secrets or find yourself in awful predicaments due to your curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini games. Go do some illegal fishing within the city and sell your catches in the Fishy Black Market, race down a giant tube sock, get distracted with arcade games while there's impending doom happening in the main objective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sock-stealing slugs that vehemently believe they're snails.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/3719f1c047eb5f52212e4a0a8741cca5.webp?t=1783178219\" width=139 height=62 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/7d904223a66d51fc74a82db4ae3a5133.webp?t=1783178219\" width=131 height=60 /></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/ea6eb5324d0acbf2ff861a454e169164.avif?t=1783178219\" width=211 height=140 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>No prophecies. No legends foretold. No destined hero.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/aa16d36d05c5891e693094fbd5c5cbce.gif?t=1783178219\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/aa16d36d05c5891e693094fbd5c5cbce.poster.avif?t=1783178219\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/d9c0b01cde3718c76a98294b00ce8849.avif?t=1783178219\" width=149 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blackout within the city of Oasys causes havoc as people and creatures wake up with new powers. Each party member controls an element which can combo off another. Light up an enemy who just got oil bombed, electrocute a ruffian after they got drenched in water - and many more possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/2189351e2e715e2269c3527add756dca.poster.avif?t=1783178219\" width=84 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109460/extras/2189351e2e715e2269c3527add756dca.webm?t=1783178219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset